      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait what do u mean by 'goblin's gold' effect? i've never heard of that in plant care. is that a real thing or just a nickname? and what did u mean by the goblin stealing the nutrients part lol i'm a bit confused",
      "source": "evaluator"
